{"lines":[{"x":0.086397278813331965,"y":0.084014469315785489,"h":0.01801757296668427,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.1204385248819987},{"c":1,"y":0.13791487192043317,"h":0.011960953800277507,"w":0.065886866251627596,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.090176867534702249},{"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.060319646199544275,"x":0.092020627941089894,"y":0.22211695975556189,"h":0.012161429283009451,"c":1},{"t":"That's right. So they don't have any problem getting their ingredients. They're","x":0.20406410335286571,"y":0.10624618110632156,"w":0.62605422973632807,"h":0.050485580257654039,"c":1},{"y":0.12588773676314235,"w":0.62201121012369787,"h":0.046268396813563872,"t":"right next door. And they also offer a special two-hour course in how to use a","x":0.20408913958577321,"c":1},{"y":0.14555571302803116,"w":0.6162085978190105,"c":1,"t":"knife. They cover all the different skills - buying them, sharpening, chopping","h":0.040999501578975139,"x":0.2040898195426151},{"t":"techniques. It gets booked up quickly though so you'd need to check it was","h":0.044456489302616142,"y":0.16135370025792861,"c":1,"x":0.20410824087404081,"w":0.60886205037434893},{"y":0.20197811217593564,"h":0.014648426446466356,"x":0.20674945070535197,"c":1,"w":0.078982302347819028,"t":"available."},{"c":1,"y":0.20811057476574812,"t":"Right, well thank you very much. I'Il go and...","x":0.20795520514592472,"h":0.030668299196615401,"w":0.36215120951334634},{"y":0.14680232566020601,"w":0.037593984603881858,"c":1,"x":0.85526315782337237,"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"Q10"},{"w":0.15413533528645834,"c":1,"t":"SECTION 2","x":0.095864663272294925,"y":0.27173213130308604,"h":0.01899549259497757},{"h":0.032459971372035712,"c":1,"t":"Good evening everyone. My name's Phil Sutton, and I'm chairman of the Highways","y":0.29169007782217871,"w":0.66257553100585942,"x":0.097357983575716581},{"x":0.095629239449886452,"w":0.68115554809570311,"h":0.030677996830101972,"t":"Committee. We've called this meeting to inform members of the public about the new","c":1,"y":0.30944226835197242},{"t":"regulations for traffic and parking we're proposing for Granford. I'Il start by summarising these","y":0.32555531395357462,"w":0.75071370442708329,"h":0.031840059731134018,"c":1,"x":0.095482613076824041},{"h":0.021652968407291362,"c":1,"w":0.39716110229492185,"x":0.099313071319056312,"y":0.35104911479734524,"t":"changes before we open the meeting to questions."},{"t":"So, why do we need to make these changes to traffic systems in Granford? Well, we're very","h":0.027884304638609025,"c":1,"y":0.3705976669550155,"w":0.731785888671875,"x":0.10119752441233354},{"c":1,"w":0.73359909057617179,"h":0.026587260897821263,"t":"aware that traffic is becoming an increasing problem. It's been especially noticeable with the","x":0.10123642077937972,"y":0.38819657869815694},{"t":"increase in heavy traffic while they've been building the new hospital. But it's the overall rise","h":0.024918226449626268,"y":0.40650669511315751,"c":1,"x":0.099446100409863528,"w":0.73716059366861975},{"w":0.74095057169596346,"t":"in the volume of traffic of all kinds that's concerning us. To date there's not been any increase","h":0.023350103394262245,"y":0.42381769089953658,"x":0.10132184212795589,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10143027801403884,"y":0.44450681912489931,"t":"in traffic accidents, but that's not something we want to see happen, obviously.","w":0.62044072469075529,"h":0.01821732751339078},{"h":0.019004240852744103,"c":1,"t":"We recently carried out a survey of local residents, and their responses were interesting.","y":0.46934042943647869,"w":0.7012478637695313,"x":0.1033185302427744},{"y":0.48689492814290891,"t":"People were very concerned about the lack of visibility on some roads due to cars parked","h":0.017394409130560673,"x":0.10522225251248785,"w":0.70685343424479163,"c":1},{"w":0.74060150146484371,"t":"along the sides of the roads. We'd expected complaints about the congestion near the school","x":0.10526315894899824,"y":0.50436046484287878,"c":1,"h":0.015988372635703185},{"x":0.10707642298790461,"y":0.51965352032261591,"t":"when parents are dropping off their children or picking them up, but this wasn't top of the list,","w":0.73135025024414058,"c":1,"h":0.020348724517527561},{"h":0.021433175032321561,"c":1,"t":"and nor were noise and fumes from trucks and lorries, though they were mentioned by some","y":0.53558966799867802,"w":0.72955708821614584,"x":0.10702788680990191},{"y":0.55377906978569058,"w":0.060150375366210929,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.10902255681877424,"c":1,"t":"people."},{"y":0.57679827335467293,"c":1,"w":0.72971038818359379,"h":0.022307313033556486,"t":"We think these new traffic regulations would make a lot of difference. But we still have a long","x":0.10883900322803897},{"h":0.026738885902851894,"y":0.59139798233545304,"t":"way to go. We've managed to keep our proposals within budget, just, so they can be covered","w":0.73356577555338542,"x":0.10880976106067881,"c":1},{"x":0.11068533241829651,"w":0.7804504903157552,"y":0.60994513957281471,"c":1,"h":0.024234091322113516,"t":"by the Council. But. of course, it's no good introducing new regulations if we don't have a way Q13"},{"c":1,"t":"of making sure that everyone obeys them, and that's an area we're still working on with the","w":0.71304295857747391,"x":0.11061571916012658,"h":0.029127601186306529,"y":0.62383962182953745},{"w":0.34288398742675785,"t":"help of representatives from the police force.","x":0.11241215601238792,"y":0.6408660419049248,"h":0.022078556470999988,"c":1},{"h":0.034792422941248402,"t":"OK, so this slide shows a map of the central area of Granford, with the High Street in the","c":1,"x":0.11603077931875722,"w":0.68903035481770836,"y":0.68633657979269413},{"y":0.70554233359418195,"x":0.11610335949987113,"h":0.031153989007069227,"t":"middle and School Road on the right. Now, we already have a set of traffic lights in the High","c":1,"w":0.71514877319335934},{"y":0.72036151476789034,"h":0.033460717775402493,"x":0.11608258582714276,"t":"Street at the junction with Station Road, but we're planning to have another set at the other","c":1,"w":0.7114888000488282},{"w":0.65533874511718748,"h":0.035730150693167539,"c":1,"y":0.73538313137471012,"t":"end, at the School Road junction, to regulate the flow of traffic along the High Street.","x":0.11605486126590089},{"c":1,"t":"We've decided we definitely need a pedestrian crossing. We considered putting this on","y":0.75872737094283116,"x":0.11771729134735542,"w":0.67249903361002605,"h":0.03844981122922686},{"h":0.036737652033740131,"x":0.11968889174984194,"t":"School Road, just outside the school, but in the end we decided that could lead to a lot of","c":1,"y":0.7749893570472508,"w":0.69109741210937492},{"w":0.70616078694661455,"y":0.78987815502696468,"h":0.039523406559931251,"x":0.1178584769439819,"t":"traffic congestion so we decided to locate it on the High Street, crossing the road in front of","c":1},{"x":0.11961708048725858,"t":"the supermarket. That's a very busy area, so it should help things there.","y":0.80484895387161748,"c":1,"w":0.55058054606119788,"h":0.037116402591034769},{"c":1,"y":0.82777650996311125,"t":"We're proposing some changes to parking. At present, parking isn't allowed on the High","x":0.12146669241871924,"w":0.68038487752278654,"h":0.043140025731447151},{"c":1,"t":"Street outside the library, but we're going to change that, and allow parking there, but not at","y":0.84357174347794828,"w":0.70647125244140629,"h":0.045096943321645599,"x":0.12144482411623017},{"c":1,"w":0.3884922536214192,"h":0.026963206313919796,"x":0.12157681936976332,"y":0.86154627170479692,"t":"the other end of the High Street near School Road."},{"h":0.047565840937902504,"c":1,"w":0.66932779947916665,"t":"There'll be a new 'No Parking' sign on School Road, just by the entrance to the school.","x":0.12150127628409688,"y":0.88034488734255179},{"w":0.69566879272460935,"h":0.049923603870910105,"c":1,"y":0.89641677426465394,"t":"forbidding parking for 25 metres. This should improve visibility for drivers and pedestrians,","x":0.12142889471508435},{"c":1,"t":"especially on the bend just to the north of the school.","w":0.39958572387695307,"h":0.026009170915415658,"y":0.91752704667247686,"x":0.12361864617895794},{"t":"Q14","x":0.85338345839135565,"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1,"y":0.71802325594121386,"w":0.035714286168416431},{"x":0.85017616447943922,"t":"Q15","h":0.017799276731433444,"c":1,"y":0.80880670960435508,"w":0.0387392552693685},{"y":0.85029069795054557,"x":0.85150375954642998,"t":"Q16","c":1,"h":0.015988371407532842,"w":0.037593984603881858},{"t":"Q17","y":0.90777497094084847,"w":0.037028992970784436,"x":0.85000670532574496,"h":0.017549087367208283,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3106}